          ],
          "value": "Carbonic anhydrase (CA) activity is probably under redox control to remain inactive in the cytoplasm. CA activity of full-length protein inhibited by ethoxyzolamide, and for both full-length and CcmM 1-209 construct by reducing agents"
        }
      ],
      "commentType": "ACTIVITY REGULATION"
