              "id": "30591587"
            }
          ],
          "value": "The N-terminal structure crystallizes as a homotrimer; zinc is bound between adjacent monomers (PubMed:20133749). The C-terminal RbcS-like domains bind to holo-RuBisCO (PubMed:30591587). Full length protein interacts with CcmN (By similarity)"
